<title>HONG KONG: Beiren Printing posts lower interim net.</title>
<headline>Beiren Printing posts lower interim net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (fen)		    8.7    vs 12.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (fen)	     2.5    vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    34.80  vs 50.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		     165.46 vs 202.95</p>
<p>    Company name		 Beiren Printing Machinery Holdings</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 3-7</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 14</p>
<p>NOTE - Beiren Printing is a Chinese-incorporated printing machinery maker.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
